      "cooked": "<p>When you play a game of <em><strong>Sentinels of the Multiverse</strong></em> (any edition), how do you most often determine which decks you will play with? Do you simply select the decks, or do you randomise it? Why? If the former, what criteria do you use to choose the decks?</p>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-charttype=\"pie\" data-poll-type=\"regular\" data-poll-name=\"poll\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<div class=\"poll-title\">Deck Selection Methods</div>\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"302903ebe8b7c437b7ae536755bb8660\">Chosen</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"e2177cf401733e1fd902753b447ac360\">Random</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"69488e77513d270a4f6c60c15f222305\">Mix of both</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<p>\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
