      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-13T22:10:02.680Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only decks I choose are the ones I don’t have a randomizer for (SOEP and Cauldron).</p>\n<p>I’ve played each character so many times, it’s too easy to know who’s a hard counter for a given scenario. Plus, when I think “who would I like to play this time?” the answer is usually “eh, whatever”.</p>",
