    {
      "id": 245059,
      "name": "",
      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-13T23:45:02.449Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You <em>should</em> be able to deactivate most if not all of the core game + expansion decks to leave just mod content to randomize if I’m not mistaken.</p>\n<p>As for me, I’ve been almost exclusively clicking random since including the Cauldron mod to get a mix of old and new content. I wish there were some team villains in a mod, though. I like to mix up to game mode depending how I’m feeling/how long I want to play (hours in the case of OblivAeon).</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-05-13T23:45:02.449Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 6,
