      "created_at": "2022-06-16T12:37:16.431Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Def a tad late, but I tend to do a mix for solo games - if I don’t have any specific characters in mind that I want to play, I’ll randomize a game &amp; then switch one or two characters out based on who seems fun in the moment and/or with the team.</p>\n<p>If I’m playing with others, I just choose normally based on who seems fun &amp; who works well with/fills out gaps for the other players.</p>",
